---
import Frame from './Frame.astro'
---

  <section class="feat rev" id="catalog">
    <div class="wrap feat-in">
      <div class="feat-copy" data-reveal>
        <h2>Find something to watch without leaving the player</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          A metadata service says <i>what</i> to watch: posters, localised titles, how many seasons a series has. A Torznab indexer says <i>where from</i>. Pick a release and it opens as
          a torrent, with the queue, the history and the file picker you already know.
        </p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
            <span><b>Releases are ordered by quality</b>, with dynamic range inside it and seeders deciding within a group, not by whichever rip happens to be busiest.</span></li>
          <li><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
            <span><b>The player carries no API key</b>: metadata goes through a small proxy of the project's own, and posters come straight from the CDN.</span></li>
          <li><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
            <span><b>It is the one surface that tells anyone what you are looking for</b>, which is why it has a switch, and why every other feature works with it off.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-mock" data-reveal style="--dl:1">
        <div class="win" data-scene data-dur="3000" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="win-bar"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="name">Catalog<span class="sep"></span>Dust Lines (2024)</span><span class="wb-brand"><span>Frame Player</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mark"/></svg></span></div>
          <div class="posters">
            <span class="poster sel" style="--i:0"><Frame name="poster-dust-lines" slot="poster" alt="" /><span class="pt">Dust Lines</span></span>
            <span class="poster" style="--i:1"><Frame name="poster-wet-season" slot="poster" alt="" /><span class="pt">Wet Season</span></span>
            <span class="poster" style="--i:2"><Frame name="poster-night-shift" slot="poster" alt="" /><span class="pt">Night Shift</span></span>
            <span class="poster" style="--i:3"><Frame name="poster-the-crossing" slot="poster" alt="" /><span class="pt">The Crossing</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="rel">
            <div class="rel-row" style="--i:0"><span class="q hdr">2160p HDR</span><span class="nm">WEB-DL<span class="sep"></span>DV/HDR10<span class="sep"></span>E-AC-3 5.1</span><span class="seed">214<svg class="ic stat" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></span></div>
            <div class="rel-row" style="--i:1"><span class="q">2160p</span><span class="nm">WEB-DL<span class="sep"></span>SDR<span class="sep"></span>AAC 5.1</span><span class="seed">96<svg class="ic stat" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></span></div>
            <div class="rel-row" style="--i:2"><span class="q">1080p</span><span class="nm">BDRip<span class="sep"></span>x264<span class="sep"></span>2 dubs</span><span class="seed">431<svg class="ic stat" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
